                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's worth it for an hour.... but other wise, no.\r\n\r\nThe 46 minutes I really REALLY enjoyed it. It makes me want to watch the show again and then makes me sad because Netflix removed it. You really only get to play as Lance and a little bit of Allura. And once it ended it was like \"that's IT???\". \r\n\r\nWorks with Meta Quest 3.\r\nWorth it for an hour... :)",
